    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly offers for sale this impeccable three bedroom semi-detached property situated in the hugely popular Mill Farm development in Carrigaline.\r\n\r\nThis property is in show house condition throughout and is magnificently finished presented by its current owners. It is completed to the highest of standards with excellent quality fixtures & fittings evident throughout and is beautifully decorated with nice bright natural decor. It includes many features such as modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, wooden floors on ground floor, built in wardrobes, fully tiled bathrooms just to name a few. \r\n\r\nExternally it has a lovely private rear garden that is directly south-east facing, featuring a beautiful patio area and to the front, it has a cobble-lock driveway with parking for two cars as well as having the benefit of enjoying a quiet cul de sac location and overlooking a large green area. \r\n\r\nIt is most conveniently located just a short distance to all amenities and services in Carrigaline and is only a very short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy. It also has a regular public bus service available close by.\r\n\r\nViewing of this immaculate home in turnkey condition comes highly recommended to see what a gem this is."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.67m x 2.74m \r\nComposite front door with glaze panel, wooden floor, centre lights, carpet stairway, under stair storage. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.49m x 1.4m \r\nWooden floor, centre globe light, WC, WHB with tile surround, decorative wallpaper.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Area - 6.02m x 5.85m \r\nWooden floor, extensive modern fitted kitchen unit with integrated induction hob, overhead extractor unit, oven, dishwasher and fridge/freezer, tile splashback, centre lights/recessed lighting, curtain pole, curtains, French doors to rear garden. \r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.7m x 1.55m \r\nWooden floor, side door, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, centre light. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - \r\nWooden floor, centre light, curtain pole, curtains, window blind, TV point. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - \r\nCarpet floor, linen press with shelving, stira stairs leading to overhead floored attic, centre lights. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.4m x 3.32m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, large wardrobe unit, curtain pole, curtains, window blind. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 2.69m x 2.39m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB, wall mirror with light, power shower unit with enclosure. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m x 4.16m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, curtain pole, curtains. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.08m x 2.6m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, decorative panelling, curtain pole, curtains. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.98m x 1.68m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WHB with wall shelf and wall mirror, WC, bath unit with power shower and enclosure. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: c. 120.1 sq metres (1,291 sq ft)\r\nAir to Water Heat Pump \r\nUnderfloor heating on ground floor\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nA2 Rated Modern Semi-Detached\r\nStira stairs leading to floored attic\r\nShowhouse condition throughout\r\nExtensive modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\nBeautiful private rear garden with patio area\r\nOverlooking large green area\r\nQuiet cul de sac position\r\nCobble lock driveway with parking for two cars\r\nHugely popular residential location\r\n24 hour regular public bus services\r\nClose to all amenities & services in Carrigaline\r\nShort commute to Cork city, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy"
      },
